# Kubeconfigs. NEVER commit one: they carry bearer tokens and client
# certs, and this repo is public. Eight were tracked until 2026-08-21 —
# see the commit that added this block. The .example placeholder is the
# one file that is meant to be here.
kubeconfig
kubeconfig-*.yaml
*.kubeconfig
